# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
/android/

# Signing credentials. Never commit these. With Play App Signing this is only the UPLOAD key
# (Google holds the real signing key) and a lost one can be reset from Play Console, but a
# leaked keystore still has to be revoked, so keep it out of the repo.
*.keystore
*.jks

# Godot 4.7 stores the keystore path, alias and password in .godot/export_credentials.cfg,
# which is covered by the .godot/ rule above — NOT in export_presets.cfg. Filling them in
# through the export dialog is safe.
